\[
-i (c_1 - c_2) = 4 \implies c_1 - c_2 = -4i
\]

Adding (1) and (2):

\[
2c_1 = 2 - 4i \implies c_1 = 1 - 2i
\]

Subtracting (2) from (1):

\[
2c_2 = 2 + 4i \implies c_2 = 1 + 2i
\]

Thus,

\[
\begin{pmatrix}
2 \\
4
\end{pmatrix}
= (1 - 2i) \begin{pmatrix}
1 \\
-i
\end{pmatrix}
+ (1 + 2i) \begin{pmatrix}
1 \\
i
\end{pmatrix}
\]

